{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04072","headline":"奉和圣制送张说上集贤学士赐宴得兹字 · 苏頲","name":"奉和圣制送张说上集贤学士赐宴得兹字","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"肃肃金殿里，招贤固在兹。\n锵锵石渠内，序拜亦同时。\n宴锡欢谈道，文成贵说诗。\n用儒今作相，敦学旧爲师。\n下际天光近，中来帝渥滋。\n国朝良史载，能事日论思。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"苏頲","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_04072.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04072","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}